#: ../../reference/packages.rst:4
msgid "Package management"
msgstr "套件管理"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:7
msgid "Installing packages with ``mip``"
msgstr "使用 ``mip`` 安裝套件"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:9
msgid ""
"Network-capable boards include the ``mip`` module, which can install "
"packages from :term:`micropython-lib` and from third-party sites (including "
"GitHub, GitLab)."
msgstr ""
"具備網路功能的開發板包含 ``mip`` 模組，可從 :term:`micropython-lib` 以及第三方網站（包括 "
"GitHub、GitLab）安裝套件。"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:12
msgid ""
"``mip`` (\"mip installs packages\") is similar in concept to Python's "
"``pip`` tool, however it does not use the PyPI index, rather it uses "
":term:`micropython-lib` as its index by default. ``mip`` will automatically "
"fetch compiled :term:`.mpy file` when downloading from micropython-lib."
msgstr ""
"``mip``\\ （\"mip installs packages\"）在概念上與 Python 的 ``pip`` 工具類似，但它不使用 PyPI "
"索引，而是預設使用 :term:`micropython-lib` 作為其索引。從 micropython-lib 下載時，\\ ``mip`` "
"會自動擷取已編譯的 :term:`.mpy file`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:17
msgid "The most common way to use ``mip`` is from the REPL::"
msgstr "使用 ``mip`` 最常見的方式是從 REPL 進行：："

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:24
msgid ""
"``mip`` will detect an appropriate location on the filesystem by searching "
"``sys.path`` for the first entry ending in ``/lib``. You can override the "
"destination using ``target``, but note that this path must be in "
"``sys.path`` to be able to subsequently import it::"
msgstr ""
"``mip`` 會搜尋 ``sys.path`` 中第一個以 ``/lib`` 結尾的項目，藉此偵測檔案系統上的適當位置。您可以使用 "
"``target`` 覆寫目的地，但請注意此路徑必須位於 ``sys.path`` 中，後續才能匯入它：："

