#: ../../reference/packages.rst:79
msgid "Installing packages with ``mpremote``"
msgstr "使用 ``mpremote`` 安裝套件"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:81
msgid ""
"The :term:`mpremote` tool also includes the same functionality as ``mip`` "
"and can be used from a host PC to install packages to a locally connected "
"device (e.g. via USB or UART)::"
msgstr ""
":term:`mpremote` 工具也包含與 ``mip`` 相同的功能，可從主機 PC 將套件安裝到本機連接的裝置上（例如透過 USB 或 "
"UART）：："

