"other dependencies::"
msgstr "``package.json`` 指定了要安裝之檔案的位置以及其他相依套件：："

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:160
msgid "The ``urls`` list specifies the files to be installed according to::"
msgstr "``urls`` 清單依下列方式指定要安裝的檔案：："

